<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RSW_TaozinNest — TAOZIN SPLIT, 2026-10-17. Owner by card 2026-10-17: the nest is "A map feature with a guarding
  adult" (modelled on RSW_PreciousCave_KraytDen: adult on guard, a few grubs and silk; generates on Crags maps).
  Owner (facings sheet): grubs "can be found only in Taozin nests ... They too should be findable as treasure in
  the Crags."

  Built from shipped parts, no new C#:
    - RM_GenStep_PlacedSetPieces (mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards): one site per map, every element spawned.
    - RM_SetPieceElement_AnchoredPawn: the adult RSW_Taozin, anchored to the site (its
      CompProperties_TerritorialAnchor + RM_AnchorGuard: fights inside the radius, wanders near the nest).
    - RM_CaveElement_Pawns / RM_CaveElement_Things (mandrake.rm.stillsand, the krayt den's own vocabulary; outside a
      precious cave they fall back to the cells within ~4 of the site): 2-4 grubs, 2-3 stacks of taozin silk.
  Wired onto the Crags (RM_Abyss, the former Forsaken Crags / AB_RockyCrags, FORSAKENCRAGS_RM_MOD_BUILD_1) through
  BiomeDef.extraGenSteps by ../../Patches/RSW_TaozinNest_Abyss.xml.
  OWED: a Mod Settings on/off (needs an RM_MechanicGates.Register call in SWBestiary C#) — part of the follow-up
  TAOZIN_BRINE_TANK_BUILD_GRUB_GOES_PALE. PROVISIONAL counts.
-->
<Defs>
  <GenStepDef MayRequire="mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards,mandrake.rm.stillsand">
    <defName>RSW_GenStep_TaozinNest</defName>
    <order>966</order>
    <genStep Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.RM_GenStep_PlacedSetPieces">
      <count>1</count>
      <minEdgeDist>20</minEdgeDist>
      <minDistToPlayerStart>40</minDistToPlayerStart>
      <spotMustBeStandable>true</spotMustBeStandable>
      <warnOnFail>false</warnOnFail>
      <elements>
        <li Class="RimMandrake.EnvironmentalHazards.RM_SetPieceElement_AnchoredPawn">
          <pawnKind>RSW_Taozin</pawnKind>
        </li>
        <li Class="RimMandrake.Stillsand.RM_CaveElement_Pawns">
          <kind>RSW_TaozinGrub</kind>
          <count>2~4</count>
          <place>any</place>
        </li>
        <li Class="RimMandrake.Stillsand.RM_CaveElement_Things">
          <thing>RSW_WoolTaozin</thing>
          <stacks>2~3</stacks>
          <stackCount>15~30</stackCount>
          <place>any</place>
        </li>
      </elements>
    </genStep>
  </GenStepDef>
</Defs>
